config BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_PGPY
	bool "python-pgpy"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_PYASN1
	help
      Pretty Good Privacy (PGP) implementation in Python.
      Requires python-cryptography at runtime which must be
      installed via pip (Rust/maturin cannot cross-compile
      for uclibc targets).

	  https://github.com/SecurityInnovation/PGPy
